SUMMARY:Valencia Street: Valencia LIVE! 2026
DTSTART:20261009T000000Z
DTEND:20261009T050000Z
DTSTAMP:20261004T070156Z
UID:10040683-1791478800-1791496800@missionlocal.org
CATEGORIES:arts,community,drink,festival,food,music
DESCRIPTION:Valencia LIVE! is back for a 2026 season! See you in the stree
 ts for a FREE\, all-ages monthly neighborhood celebration with live music\
 , cocktails to go\, restaurants\, art\, shopping\, and tons of fun in the 
 streets. \n🎸Live music curated by Carnaval SF. \nFind the party on sele
 ct blocks of Valencia Street between 16th and 21st Streets—in the Americ
 an Indian Cultural District—the second Thursday of every month from May 
 to October of 2026 from 5-10pm. \nTHIS YEAR THIS STREET PARTY IS ON THE MO
 VE!\nSave the dates and the locations: \n🗓️ May 14 and June 11\n📍 
 Valencia St. between 16th and 19th \n🗓️ July 9 and Aug 13\n📍 Valen
 cia St. between 17th and 20th \n🗓️ Sept 10 and Oct 8\n📍 Valencia S
 t. between 18th and 21st \n___ \nValencia LIVE! is a program of the Valenc
 ia Corridors Merchants Association\, presented in partnership with Into Th
 e Streets and the Civic Joy Fund. \nFunding provided by Michael Seibel\, C
 rankstart\, Chris Larsen\, Friend Family Philanthropic Fund\, Joby Pritzke
 r\, and Summer of Music. \nLocated in the American Indian Cultural Distric
 t. Founded on March 31st\, 2020\, the American Indian Cultural District (A
 ICD) is the first established Cultural District of its size in the United 
 States dedicated to recognizing\, honoring\, and celebrating the American 
 Indian legacy\, culture\, people\, and contributions.
LAST-MODIFIED:20261004T070156Z
LOCATION:Valencia Street\, 21st to 24th Streets\, San Francisco \, CA\, 94
 110\, United States
URL:https://missionlocal.org/event/valencia-street-valencia-live-2026/?utm
 _source=caldiscovery&utm_medium=ics&utm_campaign=san-francisco-ca
