BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Follow the Music
DTSTART:20261010T200000Z
DTEND:20261010T230000Z
DTSTAMP:20261002T005224Z
UID:10003801-1791637200-1791648000@ybgfestival.org
CATEGORIES:family,festival,music
DESCRIPTION:Free RSVP \nSince launching in 2023 Follow the Music has been 
 at the forefront of a rising movement promoting arts education around the 
 Bay Area. The nonprofit organization introduces its next phase with an eme
 rging artists music festival designed to showcase aspiring young musicians
 . Bringing families and young people from all over the region to the urban
  oasis of the Gardens\, Follow the Music celebrates the Bay Area’s unriv
 aled cultural heritage by building a bridge between that legacy and the yo
 ung people carrying it forward. Featuring musicians ages 14-25\, the event
  includes musicians from the San Francisco Community Music Center\, Oaklan
 d School for the Arts\, SFJAZZ\, GLIDE Memorial Church\, Blue Bear School 
 of Music\, Elevate Oakland\, Enriching Lives Through Music and other organ
 izations. Drawing on the Bay Area’s cultural diversity\, the lineup cros
 ses genres from classical and jazz to soul\, rock and Latin jazz. It also 
 features guest speakers from music\, sports and popular culture\, emceed b
 y Maya Hernandez from KEXP. A community resource fair provides families an
 d students with opportunities to connect directly with many Bay Area music
  education programs while learning about classes and scholarships. The mus
 e can take many pathways and Follow the Music is here to ensure that all a
 re open.  \nOakland Rising\, a collective developed in partnership with F
 ollow the Music\, anchors the program. The group includes B. Deveaux\, Aug
 ust Lee Stevens and Naima\, all rising stars continuing Oakland’s ferven
 t musical and cultural legacy. \nParticipating Artists\nMiles Turk & Frien
 ds \nMamboleo \nOxymora \nELM Youth Orchestra \nOSA Vocal Ensemble \nFree 
 RSVP
LAST-MODIFIED:20261002T005224Z
LOCATION:Great Lawn\, Yerba Buena Gardens\, Mission St. between 3rd & 4th 
 Sts.\, San Francisco\, CA\, 94103\, United States
URL:https://ybgfestival.org/event/follow-the-music/?utm_source=caldiscover
 y&utm_medium=ics&utm_campaign=san-francisco-ca
X-SOURCE-NAME:ybgfestival.org
X-SOURCE-URL:https://ybgfestival.org
END:VEVENT
