 minder\, but no ticket needed to attend this free event. \nThis event is s
 ponsored by: Avenue Greenlight\, an investment engine for San Francisco’
 s community projects\, providing high-impact grants with tangible results\
 ; along with Civic Center Community Benefit District\, Illuminate\, the Sa
 n Francisco Public Library and San Francisco Recreation & Parks Department
 . \n \n  \nAlso be sure to check out adjacent kid & family events\, San F
 rancisco District Attorney’s Office‘s Keepin’ It Safe in the City (C
 ivic Center Plaza\, 10am-2pm) and Market Street Arts‘ Market Street Arts
  & Theater Festival (many locations\, including UN Plaza\, with circus and
  aerial performances in the evening\, event runs 4-10pm).
