 ds of Alemany Farm and the Alemany Apartments Community for Alemany Farm
 ’s 21st Annual Harvest Festival! 🌾 \nCelebrate community\, sustainabl
 e agriculture\, and the autumn season out on the land. \n\nWhen: Saturday\
 , October 24 from 11:00 AM to 3:00 PM\nWhere: Alemany Farm\, 700 Alemany B
 lvd\, San Francisco\nCost: FREE (Donations are gratefully accepted!)\n\nWh
 at to Expect:\n\nGarlic planting 🧄\nGuided farm tours 🌿\nLive music 
