DESCRIPTION:Join us for CYC 12th Annual Chinatown Halloween Festival on Sa
 turday\, October 31 from 11am–3pm on Waverly Place (between Sacramento a
 nd Washington Street). Celebrate Halloween in the heart of Chinatown with 
 a pumpkin patch\, arts and crafts\, games\, and more family-friendly activ
 ities throughout the afternoon. \nCalling all ghosts\, superheroes\, monst
 ers\, princesses\, and creative characters. Put on your most imaginative H
 alloween costume and compete for exciting Chinatown dining prizes. \nThere
  will be four competition categories: \n• Children: Ages 0–11\n• Tee
 ns: Ages 12–17\n• Adults: Ages 18+\n• Families & Groups \nThe top th
 ree winners in each category will each receive a $50 dining gift certifica
 te to a signature Chinatown restaurant. \nPre-register here by Wednesday O
 ctober 28. \nThank you to our sponsor San Francisco Office of Economic and
  Workforce development and our partners Chinatown United Merchants Associa
 tion\, LionDanceMe\, and Self-Help for the Elderly for making this event p
 ossible. Another big thanks goes to Arata’s Pumpkin Farm\, Clancy’s Pu
 mpkins & Christmas Tree\, and Sloat Garden Center for donating pumpkins.
LAST-MODIFIED:20260922T195247Z
