 ubba Hubba Revue:\n\n  Aerialist Joanna Animal\n  Aerialist Errol Skynn\n 
  Roller skater Alicia Reason\n  The Infamous Luma Jaguar\n  Szandora LaVey
 \n\nCostume contest hosted by: MC Kingfish\n\nIf there was ever a holiday 
