DESCRIPTION:Come Eat\, Drink\, Shop\, Play\, Connect\, and Be Local at the
  10th Annual Sunset Holiday Mercantile at the County Fair Building in Go
 lden Gate Park!Sunset Holiday Mercantile in 2025 which features TWO DAYS o
 f artisan makers and vendors\, plus live music\, food\, activities and mor
 e!We are also partnering with Sharon Arts Studios and there will be a seco
 nd room of artists. More details on that soon so stay tuned!Admission is f
 ree! Come to the County Fair Building in Golden Gate Park\, December 6th a
 nd 7th from 11 AM to 5 PM to join the fun.Enjoy:50+ Local Makers\, Merchan
 ts\, Artists and VendorsFood Artisans and Food TrucksHoliday themed photo 
 boothChildren + Family ActivitiesLive MusicStorytellingCommunity CausesBee
 r + Wine TastingFree admissionWhile in the neighborhood\, be sure to explo
 re all the unique shops and eateries of the Inner Sunset!Eat\, Drink\, Sho
 p\, Play\, Connect\, and Be Local with Sunset Mercantile.For more informat
 ion please visit us on our website: https://sunsetmercantilesf.com/sunset
 holidaymercantile/
