BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Terpnami 2026
DTSTART:20261205T200000Z
DTEND:20261206T200000Z
DTSTAMP:20260919T151655Z
UID:Indybay-18888339
CATEGORIES:arts,drink,festival,food
DESCRIPTION:The highest-level genetics conversation in the world returns t
 o the Bay Area this December to help growers worldwide garden harder\, bet
 ter\, faster\, and stronger. \n\nOver 1\,000 growers big and small from ar
 ound the world interact with 30 of the world’s top breeders over two day
 s December 5 and 6 in a private Bay Area venue for TERPNAMI. Guests can RS
 VP today to get ticketing and event details.\n\nThe world’s first only 
 ‘seed rave\,’ Terpnami runs 12 to 5 p.m. Saturday and Sunday\, Decembe
 r 5 and 6\, with live DJs\, visuals\, local food\, drink\, and creative ar
 t and merch collabs\; plus pre and after-parties\, dinners and meetups.\n\
 n“Terpnami is the most important seed show in the world\,” said Califo
 rnia breeder Purple Caper. \n\nWhy Terpnami 2026?\n\nCalifornia remains th
 e global cannabis epicenter for genetic innovation. Virtually every hot st
 rain in the $60 billion U.S. market\, and the global cannabis market beyon
 d\, traces its roots to genetics bred or popularized in California. Lemon 
 Cherry Gelato\, Z\, GSC\, OG Kush\, and GDP are just few California creati
 ons.\n\nTerpnami keeps the Bay Area cannabis genetics beacon lit every Dec
 ember\, a time of year when the full-sun harvest seeds are shucked and pac
 kaged\, and folks are flush with cash for Christmas and thinking about wha
 t to grow in 2027.\n\nFor year three\, Terpnami again shifts to a new venu
 e with historic\, theatrical features\, crucial mass transit access\, and 
 more amenities for guests including off-street parking\, and a dedicated r
 estaurant.  Our first spotlighted guests include:\n\n-Exotic Genetix\n-Equ
 ilibrium Genetics\n-Maine Trees (maker of Blue Lobster)\n-Michigan’s Voy
 age Bloom (Slurmz)\n-Grove Bags with TerpLoc\n-Purple Caper\n-Zeed Vault |
  Grandiflora\n-and many more.\n\n-RSVP for Day 1 here: https://sfspacewalk
 .com/event/terpnami-seed-show-2026-day-1/\n-RSVP for Day 2 here: https://s
 fspacewalk.com/event/terpnami-seed-show-2026-day-2/\nhttps://www.indybay.o
 rg/newsitems/2026/08/31/18888339.php
LAST-MODIFIED:20260919T151655Z
LOCATION:RSVP for Details
URL:https://www.indybay.org/newsitems/2026/08/31/18888339.php?utm_source=c
 aldiscovery&utm_medium=ics&utm_campaign=san-francisco-ca
X-SOURCE-NAME:Indybay
X-SOURCE-URL:https://www.indybay.org/newsitems/2020/06/18/18834327.php
END:VEVENT
